              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What does تحویل گرفتن (tahvil gereftan) mean? (\"To receive, to take delivery of; to check in (to a room)\".) Say it once more."
