          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تسویه حساب کردن (tasviye hesâb kardan) — \"to settle the bill, to settle up; to check out\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "صبح با هتل تسویه حساب کردیم و رفتیم. Sobh bâ hotel tasviye hesâb kardim va raftim. In the morning we settled up with the hotel and left."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "tasviye 'settling' + hesâb 'account' + kardan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "tasviye hesâb kardan is built from tasviye 'levelling, settling', a loan usually traced to Arabic taswiya, hesâb 'account', borrowed from Arabic ḥisāb (EtymDB), and kardan 'to do'."
            }
          ]
        },
